WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.749
Monthly skill assessments

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:08.993
Open Academics, then Assessments.

00:00:11.464 --> 00:00:17.097
Choose the class and the month. The roster loads every student in that class.

00:00:17.554 --> 00:00:22.608
Rate a skill and a behaviour for the first student, then write a teacher remark.

00:00:33.785 --> 00:00:37.189
Press Save Month to save the whole class at once.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.143
Assessments saved
